  'q7:3': 'Start with the Product Owner gap. Name the gap, escalate it, and get the team a clear direction.',
  'q8:0': 'Put that time into coaching the team’s craft. Work with the team to pick one area they want to improve over the next few Sprints.',
};

const PROFILES = [
  {
    name: 'The common case: a full-time Scrum Master buried in admin',
    blurb:
      'Hours go to the events and the ticket pile. People come for judgment, the one bright spot. Coaching and the Product Owner get nothing. Bottom left is empty.',
